<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50363" body-key="">*<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵλημι</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>,= foreg., only in imper.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵληθι</span>, in prayers, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>be gracious!</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.380
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				16.184
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Hom.</u>
				20.8
			</span></i>, etc.: 
				Aeol.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλλᾱθι</span></b>  (q. v.): 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵλᾰθι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				15.143
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Epigr.</u>
				22
			</span></i>; both together, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵλᾰθ᾽, ἄναξ, ἵληθι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.158
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Mel.
			</span></i>): pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵλᾰτε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.984
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Man.
				6.754
			</span></i>. (Prob. pf. imper. fr. <i>se-sl-</i>; 
				Aeol.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔλλ-</span> points to <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἵλ-</span> as the true 
				Ion.
			 spelling; 
				Dor.
			
			pf.
			part. dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱλαότι</span>
			(leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἱλ-</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ</span> is genuine in
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵλεως, ἱλάσκομαι</span> [fr.
				<i>si-sl-</i>].)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
